WEBVTT

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:11.611
One block in the project config runs a named Cloudflare tunnel, at a hostname you own, behind Cloudflare Access.

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:20.887
A stranger gets the Access login.

00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:37.651
Go around Cloudflare with a forged token, and agnt's origin check refuses it.

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:45.978
An allowed caller gets through.

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:51.913
In a browser, that stranger sees Cloudflare's login page.

00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:05.369
And the app sees the request the way the browser made it: https, at the public hostname.

